'''Malediction''' is a [[debuff]] that causes affected targets to deal reduced damage and take increased damage.

==Related unique items==
The following [[unique item]]s are related to Malediction:
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|where=items.stat_text LIKE "%Malediction%" 
  OR items.name IN ("Glimpse of Chaos", "Cinderswallow Urn")
|large=1
|base_item=1
|level=1
|stat=1
}}

==Related passive skills==
The table below displays [[passive skills]] related to Malediction.

{{Query base passive skills
|where=
  passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%Malediction%" AND passive_skills.id NOT LIKE "%AlternateAscendancy%" AND passive_skills.id NOT LIKE "%AscendancyCustom%"
}}
===Cluster Jewel passive skills===
The following [[Cluster Jewel]] [[passive skill]]s are related to Malediction:
